OL,3,GStrathclyde
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FIt will be cloudy with
OL,6,Foutbreaks of mostly light rain
OL,7,Fspreading northwards in the morning.
OL,8,FBecoming generally drier in the
OL,9,Fafternoon with some bright spells
OL,10,Fpossible. Warm and humid.
OL,11,
OL,12,CTonight:FRather cloudy with some
OL,13,Fpatchy rain at first. More persistent
OL,14,Fand occasionally heavy rain will
OL,15,Fspread north later in the evening and
OL,16,Fovernight.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
